s real impact.","Our story so far",[93,123,153,180,199,216,266],{"primary":94,"items":104,"id":121,"slice_type":122,"slice_label":5},{"item_year":95,"item_title":96,"item_subtitle":97,"item_description":98},"2012","Recruitment Reimagined","Foundation for Skill & Profile Verification",[99],{"type":100,"text":101,"spans":102,"direction":103},"paragraph","HireConnect was founded by passionate engineers and recruiters who realized traditional job boards were plagued by resume noise, slow response times, and unverified credentials.",[],"ltr",[105,113],{"item_image":106},{"dimensions":107,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":110,"id":111,"edit":112},{"width":108,"height":109},1280,1760,"https://images.prismic.io/blueprint/aXkedAIvOtkhCAX__2012-AdobeStock_327279813_Editorial_Use_Only-min-1-1-708x4001.png?auto=format,compress","aXkedAIvOtkhCAX_",{"x":30,"y":30,"zoom":31,"background":32},{"item_image":114},{"dimensions":115,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":118,"id":119,"edit":120},{"width":116,"height":117},1120,1048,"https://images.prismic.io/blueprint/aXkecwIvOtkhCAX-_istockphoto-1469706272-2048x20481.png?auto=format,compress","aXkecwIvOtkhCAX-",{"x":30,"y":30,"zoom":31,"background":32},"timeline_item$5c6b2358-8b71-4cd3-80b6-2469e78d605c","timeline_item",{"primary":124,"items":132,"id":152,"slice_type":122,"slice_label":5},{"item_year":125,"item_title":126,"item_subtitle":127,"item_description":128},"2014","Building the MERN Architecture","Root of HireConnect’s focus on quality, not volume.",[129],{"type":100,"text":130,"spans":131,"direction":103},"We built a modern MERN-stack architecture connecting interactive candidate profiles, recruiter applicant tracking, and direct company hiring into one unified ecosystem.",[],[133,139,145],{"item_image":134},{"dimensions":135,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":136,"id":137,"edit":138},{"width":108,"height":116},"https://images.prismic.io/blueprint/aXkecgIvOtkhCAX9_2014-office1.png?auto=format,compress","aXkecgIvOtkhCAX9",{"x":30,"y":30,"zoom":31,"bac