2018","Scaling Hiring Partnerships","Partnership across the entire hiring lifecycle.",[186],{"type":100,"text":187,"spans":188,"direction":103},"Leading startups and enterprise teams adopted HireConnect to manage recruitment pipelines, dramatically reducing time-to-hire while elevating candidate satisfaction.",[],[190],{"item_image":191},{"dimensions":192,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":195,"id":196,"edit":197},{"width":193,"height":194},1440,1920,"https://images.prismic.io/blueprint/aXkebQIvOtkhCAX1_2018-dj1.png?auto=format,compress","aXkebQIvOtkhCAX1",{"x":30,"y":30,"zoom":31,"background":32},"timeline_item$239ae0c3-a7ef-4535-9c71-301edbab13ba",{"primary":200,"items":208,"id":215,"slice_type":122,"slice_label":5},{"item_year":201,"item_title":202,"item_subtitle":203,"item_description":204},"2020","Flexible Hiring & Recruitment Workflows","Flexibility for companies, opportunity for candidates.",[205],{"type":100,"text":206,"spans":207,"direction":103},"HireConnect introduced flexible models including direct full-time placement, contract-to-hire, and dedicated team staffing, giving recruiters and companies maximum flexibility.",[],[209],{"item_image":210},{"dimensions":211,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":212,"id":213,"edit":214},{"width":175,"height":194},"https://images.prismic.io/blueprint/aXkebAIvOtkhCAXy_2018-dj2.png?auto=format,compress","aXkebAIvOtkhCAXy",{"x":30,"y":30,"zoom":31,"background":32},"timeline_item$59f807d5-6512-43ce-938e-eadabbaf3a81",{"primary":217,"items":225,"id":265,"slice_type":122,"slice_label":5},{"item_year":218,"item_title":219,"item_subtitle":220,"item_description":221},"2022","Ecosystem Growth","Proven retention, trust, and career growth.",[222],{"type":100,"text":223,"spans":224,"direction":103},"HireConnect expanded nationwide, helping thousands of job seekers find impactful roles and enabling companies to build high-retention engineering teams.",[],[226,232,239,245,252,259],{"item_image":227},{"dimensions":228,"alt":5,"copyright":5,"url":22